github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_material_thumbnail.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23377408/test_material_thumbnail.zip)\r\n\r\n## Visual comparison\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"258\" height=\"464\" alt=\"Screenshot_20251106_000929\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b4783448-e288-4160-95ca-ee5be963bd35\" /> | <img width=\"258\" height=\"464\" alt=\"Screenshot_20251106_000853\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3391e31d-17d0-48fb-843e-276b04e00910\" />\r\n\r\nOn top of smoother edges, this avoids the dark spot at the left of each material.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-6000 CL30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 42)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nTime taken to generate *one* thumbnail (average of 1000 materials that reference the same texture, but with a different albedo color each). Time is measured using `--verbose` output and `~/.cache/godot/` removed before every run:\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n19.27 usec | 20.04 usec\r\n\r\nOverall, thumbnail generation is slightly slower, but I'd say it's worth the quality increase here.\r\n\r\nI suppose https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97468 can make use of a similar setup with the sky/environment to improve mesh previews.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112325#pullrequestreview-3424906131","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112325","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112325#pullrequestreview-3424906131"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112325"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-05T23:11:26Z","commit_id":null}]